  "limitations": [
    "The capabilities command is static metadata: it does not check authentication, browser state, source reachability, or real source acceptance.",
    "Source commands require an existing authenticated Kemai session and the shared source gate; access=read does not bypass either requirement.",
    "Export-start commands create or reuse a source-side export task. The shared source gate rejects these commands before any source request.",
    "export-download writes only the explicitly requested local XLSX artifact and its integrity metadata; it does not write a data center.",
    "Signed source download URLs are private runtime inputs and are not part of public columns or capabilities output.",
    "Source transports advertise commands only; field coverage, cross-source identity, data-center acceptance and route selection belong to the runner."
  ],
